WHY SHARE-ALIKE FOR CONTENT

Writing a good exam question — a realistic scenario, plausible distractors, and
an explanation of why each wrong answer is wrong — is the expensive part of this
project. ShareAlike means the bank can be reused freely, including in commercial
training, as long as improvements stay available to everyone.

